    <sys:String x:Key="LOCImageRotaterNeedFfmpegPath" xml:space="preserve">This needs ffmpeg on your PATH.

ImageRotater cannot bundle it: ffmpeg is GPL-licensed and this plugin is MIT, so shipping the binary would change the licence of the whole project. Install ffmpeg and run this again.</sys:String>
